OL,3,GNEWSACouncil pay-out for pregnant
OL,4,Awoman's 'unsafe' home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the council said it
OL,7,Fhad apologised to the family and was
OL,8,Freviewing its "internal processes to
OL,9,Fensure we best serve residents and meet
OL,10,Ftheir needs".
